style -
control push 75 23 normal OK
control push 75 23 disabled Apply
control push 75 23 pressed Cancel
control default 75 23 normal OK
control check 160 17 normal Use drop shadows
control check-on 160 17 normal Show window contents
control check-mixed 160 17 normal Partly
control check-on 160 17 disabled Unavailable
control radio-on 160 17 normal Center
control radio 160 17 normal Tile
control group 180 80 normal Buttons
control edit 150 21 normal Text
control edit 150 21 disabled Text
control combo 150 21 normal Windows XP style
control combo-edit 150 21 normal Tahoma
control progress:60 150 18 normal
control trackbar:40 150 30 normal
control tabs 300 120 normal
control hscroll 150 17 normal
control vscroll 17 150 normal
control listview 260 100 normal
control treeview 160 100 normal
control listbox 120 80 normal
